The plate is about 26 cm across, which is roughly 360 px in the image, so about 14 px per cm. The broccoli cluster measures roughly 165 px by 230 px, or about 12 cm by 16 cm. It looks like 5 or 6 florets, and some of them are stacked, which adds height.

Florets of this size weigh about 15-20 g each, so 6 florets come to roughly 90-110 g. I'll use about 100 g. Steamed broccoli is around 35 kcal per 100 g. The surface looks slightly oily, so I'm adding a little for that, which brings the total to about 50 kcal.

{"kcal": 50, "mass_g": 100}
